{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And you shall keep My covenant.</b> This is the covenant of blood that He made with Israel, as it is written in the portion of Mishpatim." "<b>A treasured possession from all the peoples.</b> For it is in My hand to elevate you above all of them, כי לי כל הארץ (for all the earth is Mine). Another interpretation: <b>כי לי כל הארץ</b> — even though all the earth is Mine, you shall be beloved to Me above all. <b>כי</b> in the sense of אעפ״י (even though), like כי מנשה הבכור, כי קרוב הוא. [כי לי כל הארץ — all the creatures of the earth.]"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {1 "The bracketed text appears to be a marginal or parenthetical gloss; translated as presented."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:58:44.336467319Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}